# REXX: ANSI X3.274-1996 (REXX) and the ooRexx reference: keyword instructions, built-in functions; requirements/languages/rexx.md
name     rexx rex

keyword  address arg call do drop else end exit if interpret iterate leave nop numeric options otherwise
keyword  parse procedure pull push queue return say select signal then to trace upper when while until
keyword  forever by for with value var source version expose
builtin  length substr pos word words left right strip translate reverse abs max min date time
fold-case

block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   " "  : doubled
string   ' '  : doubled
operators  +-*/%&|\<>=
calls
